BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>The Shuttle stack on pad 39B</h1>
Atlantis, ready for launch on pad 39B as in "Space Shuttle Atlantis/Atlantis
satellite Launch": it stands on its mobile launcher platform (its solid
rocket boosters' skirts on the platform's deck, ALT - 18.962 m above the
ground) and must stay landed and still.
END_HYPERDESC

